#: advanced.docbook:1741
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Find backward the given text with the appropriate <replaceable>attribute</"
"replaceable>. The argument <replaceable>attribute</replaceable> is ignored "
"if it is set to <literal>-1</literal>. The returned cursor is invalid, if "
"the text could not be found."
